---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---

<Figure
  kind="Diagram"
  title="Polynomial-time reductions"
  caption="Top: a reduction f turns any instance x of A into an instance f(x) of B with the same answer, so a fast solver for B becomes a fast solver for A. Bottom: some classic reduction chains. An arrow A → B means A ≤ₚ B, so hardness flows along the arrows: because SAT is NP-complete, every problem it reaches is NP-hard too, and these are all in NP, so all are NP-complete."
>
  <div class="pipe">
    <div class="box">instance <i>x</i> of A</div>
    <div class="arr">→</div>
    <div class="box fn"><b>f</b><small>polynomial time</small></div>
    <div class="arr">→</div>
    <div class="box">instance <i>f(x)</i> of B</div>
    <div class="arr">→</div>
    <div class="box fn"><b>solver for B</b></div>
    <div class="arr">→</div>
    <div class="box ans">yes / no</div>
  </div>
  <p class="eq mono">x ∈ A ⇔ f(x) ∈ B</p>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 470 190" role="img" aria-label="Reduction chain from SAT">
    <defs>
      <marker id="nr-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" style="fill:var(--text-faint)"></path></marker>
    </defs>
    <path d="M72,95 L104,95" marker-end="url(#nr-arrow)"></path>
    <path d="M178,88 L226,32" marker-end="url(#nr-arrow)"></path>
    <path d="M178,95 L226,95" marker-end="url(#nr-arrow)"></path>
    <path d="M178,102 L226,158" marker-end="url(#nr-arrow)"></path>
    <path d="M362,160 L392,160" marker-end="url(#nr-arrow)"></path>
    <rect class="root" x="6" y="78" width="66" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="39" y="95">SAT</text>
    <rect x="106" y="78" width="72" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="142" y="95">3-SAT</text>
    <rect x="228" y="8" width="134" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="295" y="25">Clique</text>
    <rect x="228" y="78" width="134" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="295" y="95">Vertex cover</text>
    <rect x="228" y="143" width="134" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="295" y="160">Hamiltonian cycle</text>
    <rect x="394" y="143" width="70" height="34" rx="8"></rect><text x="429" y="160">TSP</text>
  </svg>
</Figure>

<style>
  .pipe {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .box {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .box small {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .fn {
    border-color: var(--g-blue);
    background: rgba(66, 133, 244, 0.12);
  }
  .ans {
    border-color: var(--g-green);
  }
  .arr {
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
  .eq {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 8px 0 14px;
    color: var(--g-yellow);
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-faint);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  rect {
    fill: var(--bg-soft);
    stroke: var(--border-strong);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  rect.root {
    stroke: var(--g-red);
  }
  text {
    font: 600 13px var(--font-mono);
    fill: var(--text);
    text-anchor: middle;
    dominant-baseline: central;
  }
</style>
